{
  "id": "E271",
  "title": "Where Are They?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-11-15",
  "synopsis": "Ben goes to meet three of his friends.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/897/e94b68520cb561187548a45911090a9f3a57f06e.mp3?1540867656",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "他们在哪儿？\n\n本：丽丽，怎么只有你一个人？小乐呢？\n丽丽：她去买水了。\n本：保罗在哪儿？\n丽丽：他去洗手间了。\n本：那我们等等他们吧。",
    "traditional": "他們在哪兒？\n\n本：麗麗，怎麼只有你一個人？小樂呢？\n麗麗：她去買水了。\n本：保羅在哪兒？\n麗麗：他去洗手間了。\n本：那我們等等他們吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，怎么只有你一个人？小乐呢？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，怎麼只有你一個人？小樂呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì zěn me zhǐ yǒu nǐ yí ge rén xiǎo lè ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, how come you are alone? Where is Little Le?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：她去买水了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：她去買水了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tā qù mǎi shuǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: She went to buy water."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：保罗在哪儿？",
      "traditional": "本：保羅在哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "běn bǎo luó zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Where is Paul?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：他去洗手间了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：他去洗手間了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tā qù xǐ shǒu jiān le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: He went to the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：那我们等等他们吧。",
      "traditional": "本：那我們等等他們吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ men děng děng tā men ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then let’s wait for them."
    }
  ],
